@startuml seq-overview-client
title Diagrama de sequencia - Overview client

actor Client as Cl
participant "Sistema QueMenges" as S
actor "Mapa / ubicacio" as M
actor "Passarella pagament" as Pay
actor Cuiner as C

Cl -> S: veure plats/menus o cuiners actius
S --> Cl: llistat

Cl -> S: fer comanda
S -> S: calcular cost enviament
S --> Cl: import total
Cl -> S: confirmar comanda
S -> C: notificar comanda

Cl -> S: pagar comanda
S -> Pay: processar pagament
Pay --> S: pagament OK
S --> Cl: pagament confirmat

Cl -> S: seguir enviament al mapa
S -> M: obtenir ubicacio
M --> S: coordenades
S --> Cl: mostrar posicio

Cl -> S: valorar comanda rebuda
S --> Cl: valoracio guardada

@enduml
